            {
                "entry_id": "64b01ca4-2e09-3ecc-a2a0-2e8eccb5d4f3",
                "word": "impostrice",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "db1d1743-7978-4c33-b458-aa01e7197f91",
                        "entry_id": "64b01ca4-2e09-3ecc-a2a0-2e8eccb5d4f3",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "impostrices"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "c793b936-41d6-4d88-a1dc-86601422d41b",
                        "entry_id": "64b01ca4-2e09-3ecc-a2a0-2e8eccb5d4f3",
                        "tags": [
                            "masculine"
                        ],
                        "form": "imposteur"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e90301cd-fda7-34e9-a077-8a1cfa2fff08",
                        "entry_id": "64b01ca4-2e09-3ecc-a2a0-2e8eccb5d4f3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Celle qui cherche à abuser sur son compte en travestissant la réalité ou en se faisant passer pour une autre."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "be3fa424-cb35-4c03-becb-44a1364a7b74",
                                "sense_id": "e90301cd-fda7-34e9-a077-8a1cfa2fff08",
                                "text": "— Mais non. Je n’ai pas de raison de me plaindre, c’est tout. Syndrome de l’impostrice de merde…\n— Je ne crois pas qu’impostrice figure dans le dico.\n— Eh bien, ça devrait."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d55a8b5d-05ba-4527-ae70-3c910c3a10f7",
                                "sense_id": "e90301cd-fda7-34e9-a077-8a1cfa2fff08",
                                "text": "Comment ! Vous osez vous parjurer… quand je vous dis que de mes propres yeux… je suis donc une impostrice ? …"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cfd5726e-61e1-41ca-8094-92d968d89242",
                                "sense_id": "e90301cd-fda7-34e9-a077-8a1cfa2fff08",
                                "text": "Le syndrome de l’impostrice (beaucoup de femmes pensent ne pas mériter leur poste ou ne pas être à la hauteur), les congés de maternité, le plafond de verre (les femmes peuvent progresser dans la hiérarchie, mais seulement jusqu’à un certain niveau) représentent quelques-uns des obstacles qui touchent majoritairement les femmes dans le milieu universitaire et qui perpétuent/alimentent la métaphore du tuyau qui fuit (p. ex., Ysseldyk et al., 2019)."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f703525e-4cdd-4c67-a73d-29c94652394b",
                        "source_entry_id": "64b01ca4-2e09-3ecc-a2a0-2e8eccb5d4f3",
                        "source_sense_id": "e90301cd-fda7-34e9-a077-8a1cfa2fff08",
                        "source_sense_description": "Celle qui cherche à abuser",
                        "target_lang_word": "Hochstaplerin",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Hochstaplerin",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c50d3af0-b3aa-3726-80c0-6ef25d3b76b9",
                                        "entry_id": "0081dc38-5ddc-3d6a-b39d-6c01f7bb7df7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "eine weibliche Person, die bewusst (mit oder ohne betrügerische Absicht) vorgibt, eine Person höheren Ansehens (meist akademischer Grad) zu sein, um persönliche Vorteile daraus zu ziehen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "71860bb4-201f-406d-8964-3316104a17cb",
                                                "sense_id": "c50d3af0-b3aa-3726-80c0-6ef25d3b76b9",
                                                "text": "Mit einem falschen Pass reiste die Frau ein, diese Hochstaplerin, zwei Pässe hat sie!"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bc239a4b-0ef5-347d-834c-84114eb8049a",
                                        "entry_id": "0081dc38-5ddc-3d6a-b39d-6c01f7bb7df7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Angeberin"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "impolite"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cf091f3e-08a9-44e1-bc24-0fa950710de6",
                                                "sense_id": "bc239a4b-0ef5-347d-834c-84114eb8049a",
                                                "text": "Was für eine Hochstaplerin! Dabei verdient sie noch nicht einmal eigenes Geld. Alles von Papa."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c44b6faa-8059-417c-a135-652a5b5f4c51",
                        "source_entry_id": "64b01ca4-2e09-3ecc-a2a0-2e8eccb5d4f3",
                        "source_sense_id": "e90301cd-fda7-34e9-a077-8a1cfa2fff08",
                        "source_sense_description": "Celle qui cherche à abuser",
                        "target_lang_word": "Betrügerin",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Betrügerin",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "50478878-9fdd-33a9-988e-d136ec4ec3ce",
                                        "entry_id": "6bffc13e-7bfe-35fe-a997-9686ebde0f97",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "weiblicher Betrüger"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e1cad21-e02e-4758-baea-b6b55a61d4df",
                                                "sense_id": "50478878-9fdd-33a9-988e-d136ec4ec3ce",
                                                "text": "Du solltest ihr nicht trauen, dieser Betrügerin!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1fa5fc4-e952-4eaa-82b2-627007b32f9d",
                                                "sense_id": "50478878-9fdd-33a9-988e-d136ec4ec3ce",
                                                "text": "„Am 5. April 2001 erhob der Bezirksanwalt Anklage, nannte Christina Maria Kurmann aus Adliswil eine Urkundenfälscherin und Betrügerin.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "684aae1f-6f34-48fd-a58e-4bfcef887d35",
                                                "sense_id": "50478878-9fdd-33a9-988e-d136ec4ec3ce",
                                                "text": "„Da ich etwas unternehmen mußte, um die Absichten der beiden Betrügerinnen zu vereiteln, verließ ich sie wortlos und schloß mich mit Madame d'Urfé ein, um das Orakel über die Operation zu befragen, die zu ihrem Glück führen sollte.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c8aae39b-67af-4e62-90ce-b11860636499",
                        "source_entry_id": "64b01ca4-2e09-3ecc-a2a0-2e8eccb5d4f3",
                        "source_sense_id": "e90301cd-fda7-34e9-a077-8a1cfa2fff08",
                        "source_sense_description": "Celle qui cherche à abuser",
                        "target_lang_word": "impostor",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "impostor",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "66158e51-9e5b-3a34-9a2a-3dfb7fe9c499",
                                        "entry_id": "e38a1110-c824-333a-af54-95fc3b0f5713",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone who attempts to deceive by using an assumed name or identity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ee1342c-8ad5-44e9-b4be-3d223fba21e7",
                                                "sense_id": "66158e51-9e5b-3a34-9a2a-3dfb7fe9c499",
                                                "text": "\"It were dishonour in me to yield. I will not play the part of an impostor, whom my uncle must despise even while he screens. No; these estates are his right: let him take them; I will not buy them with his daughter's hand.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8cb048a-6a3f-41d9-9631-a505786dd84d",
                                                "sense_id": "66158e51-9e5b-3a34-9a2a-3dfb7fe9c499",
                                                "text": "Then again these figures take no account of the thousands of beggars who travel free in India. Many of these are religious \"Sadhus\", dressed often in nothing but a loin-cloth, or even less, and their bodies smeared with ashes. A large number of these men are nothing but impostors, but the Hindu railway staff usually are afraid to interfere with them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd9d8e1a-75a0-423b-b29a-733c145b9520",
                                                "sense_id": "66158e51-9e5b-3a34-9a2a-3dfb7fe9c499",
                                                "text": "“I said he had a criminal face.” “He can't help his face.” “He can help being a crook and an impostor. Calls himself a butler, does he? The police could shake that story. He's no more a butler than I am.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d5a45e24-026b-3e8a-a9ad-866bc40cb361",
                                        "entry_id": "e38a1110-c824-333a-af54-95fc3b0f5713",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sprite or animation integrated into a three-dimensional scene to look like part of the 3D world."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bba8a441-6ccf-30a9-8957-6925b652835c",
                                        "entry_id": "e38a1110-c824-333a-af54-95fc3b0f5713",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A term referenced in an unusual grammatical person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7927f735-0903-414c-8516-31de090ba3aa",
                                                "sense_id": "bba8a441-6ccf-30a9-8957-6925b652835c",
                                                "text": "Interestingly, Wang shows that Chinese allows the appearance of an indexical pronoun alongside the imposter, as in (31)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3890c41f-0771-469c-886d-caf9f14e5252",
                                                "sense_id": "bba8a441-6ccf-30a9-8957-6925b652835c",
                                                "text": "One possibility is that mothers of HR [higher-risk] infants frequently use non-pronoun forms in place of pronouns, as in the impostor uses noted above."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
